[I] Perl extension for using OpenSSL

[T] Net::SSLeay provides Perl bindings for the OpenSSL and LibreSSL
[T] libraries, exposing much of their API for SSL/TLS connections,
[T] certificates and cryptography. It also includes convenience functions
[T] for simple HTTPS requests and is the base of IO::Socket::SSL.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/Net-SSLeay

